<title>ARGENTINA: TABLE-Argentine grain/oilseed export snapshot.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Argentine grain/oilseed export snapshot.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Secretariat</p>
<p>weekly estimate, to July 23, of 1996/97 shipments, export</p>
<p>commitments and purchases by exporters in indicated crop years</p>
<p> ...........shipments..commits..crop year...exporter purchases</p>
<p>(thousands of tonnes).........................1997/98..1996/97</p>
<p> Bread wheat  8,358.9  9,300.0   Dec-Nov	  326.0  9,571.0</p>
<p> Forrage wheat  188.3    230.0   Dec-Nov	    n/a    188.6</p>
<p> Maize	  7,442.8  8,300.0   Mar-Feb	   34.5  8,451.5</p>
<p> Sorghum	  547.0    600.0   Mar-Feb	    n/a    611.3</p>
<p> Soybeans	 606.5    650.0   Apr-Mar	    4.2  1,311.1</p>
<p> Sunseeds	  22.3     23.0   Jan-Dec	    n/a    174.4</p>
<p>The Secretariat made the following estimates of probable</p>
<p>total 1996/97 exports (thousands of tonnes):</p>
<p> Bread wheat	    10,200.0</p>
<p> Forrage wheat		 n/a</p>
<p> Maize		     9,500.0</p>
